# Raw photo masters at repo root (unoptimized exports; processed copies live in public/images/fotos)
/fotos/

# Raw video masters at repo root (large, with audio; the muted web derivatives
# live in public/images/videos). Keep the source out of git and out of the
# static export so every deploy doesn't ship dead weight.
/video-masters/

# Raw raster masters (unoptimized PNG/JPG exports) at repo root. public/ is the
# static export root, so a raw asset there is uploaded to the CDN on every
# deploy. Processed .webp derivatives live in public/images/. Keep the source
# out of git and out of the export.
/raw-masters/

